    "lines": [
      {
        "scene": "hook",
        "text": "Toyota could sell a car to anyone, except the people who bought a Mercedes.",
        "start": 0.3,
        "seconds": 2.99,
        "window": 3.67,
        "fill": 0.815
      },
      {
        "scene": "leaving",
        "text": "Its own best customers got richer, and traded up to Mercedes and BMW.",
        "start": 3.97,
        "seconds": 3.41,
        "window": 4.07,
        "fill": 0.838
      },
      {
        "scene": "secret",
        "text": "So in 1984, Toyota started a secret project: a luxury car to win them back.",
        "start": 8.03,
        "seconds": 4.08,
        "window": 4.73,
        "fill": 0.863
      },
      {
        "scene": "testing",
        "text": "Its engineers drove test cars more than 3.5M kilometres.",
        "start": 12.77,
        "seconds": 3.09,
        "window": 3.77,
        "fill": 0.82
      },
      {
        "scene": "cost",
        "text": "Jalopnik puts the bill at about $1B. So would a Mercedes buyer ever pay that kind of money for a Toyota?",
        "start": 16.53,
        "seconds": 5.16,
        "window": 5.8,
        "fill": 0.89
      },
      {
        "scene": "turn",
        "text": "Toyota left its own name off. Six years on, it opened Lexus in America, at $35,000 a car.",
        "start": 22.33,
        "seconds": 5.43,
        "window": 6.07,
        "fill": 0.895
      },
      {
        "scene": "forecast",
        "text": "By the end of that year, Lexus had hit its forecast of 16,000 cars.",
        "start": 28.4,
        "seconds": 3.28,
        "window": 3.97,
        "fill": 0.826
      },
      {
        "scene": "payoff",
        "text": "Behind that one car, Toyota had built about 450 prototypes, before anyone had heard the name Lexus.",
        "start": 32.37,
        "seconds": 5.04,
        "window": 5.7,
        "fill": 0.884
      },
      {
        "scene": "ending",
        "text": "Lexus or Mercedes: which badge would you park outside? Either way, the Lexus was built by Toyota.",
        "start": 38.07,
        "seconds": 4.62,
        "window": 5.27,
        "fill": 0.877
      }
    ]
  },
